ts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T23:06:10-07:00","id":986597,"title":"","content":"The only thing that was too unbalanced IMO was the Mind 1 mental boosting. So as a HR I moved it to 3.<br /> <br /> It was ridicilous how many dumb mind mages were created. Perception 4 Intelligence and Wits both 1 plus Mind 1+...<br /> Until you get your first couple of chapters you have to rely on Mind to have a capable mind.<br /> Pun intended.<br /> <br /> But then you buy Intelligence and Wits for measly 4XP total at 2 each and for further 8XP at 3 each...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T23:27:57-07:00","id":986603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NicoTheDuck</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/978770-abilities-beyond-5?p=986594#post986594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is. You can find it in HDYDT.</div> </div> </div> </div>I meant back in the late 90s. I might be misremembering a house rule and I am too lazy to go digging through Mage books right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user"